From db3c17fcb759d7c3dc48fb7b1c3d2f6be1118975 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:17:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] prplmesh: stabilize startup and MLD reconfiguration

- Gate agent startup on hostapd global PONG readiness and explicit launch requests
- Handle dummy_ap radios without duplicate agent retries
- Serialize hostapd/driver MLD ADD, REMOVE, and LINK_REMOVE operations
- Wait for valid hostapd control sockets before MLD_ADD_LINK
- Clean stale control mappings and preserve per-radio VAP ownership
- Add configurable unicast-first AP configuration renewal

Signed-off-by: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
